{"tool_name":"fractal","contents":["neubias"],"fetched_metadata":{"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"basic_html","processed":"<p>Fractal is a framework to process high-content imaging data at scale and prepare it for interactive visualization.&nbsp;Fractal provides distributed workflows that convert TBs of image data into&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ngff.openmicroscopy.org/\">OME-Zarr</a>&nbsp;files. The platform then processes the 3D image data by applying tasks like illumination correction, maximum intensity projection, 3D segmentation using&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cellpose.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\">cellpose</a>&nbsp;and measurements using&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/haesleinhuepf/napari-workflows\">napari workflows</a>. The pyramidal OME-Zarr files enable interactive visualization in the napari viewer.</p>","summary":"","value":"<p>Fractal is a framework to process high-content imaging data at scale and prepare it for interactive visualization.&nbsp;Fractal provides distributed workflows that convert TBs of image data into&nbsp;<a href=\"https://ngff.openmicroscopy.org/\">OME-Zarr</a>&nbsp;files. The platform then processes the 3D image data by applying tasks like illumination correction, maximum intensity projection, 3D segmentation using&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cellpose.readthedocs.io/en/latest/\">cellpose</a>&nbsp;and measurements using&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/haesleinhuepf/napari-workflows\">napari workflows</a>. The pyramidal OME-Zarr files enable interactive visualization in the napari viewer.</p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-29T12:45:01+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2023-04-29T07:48:41+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[{"target_id":5105,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"a7c873b4-63e4-4561-89ff-70e6e6e9d15a","url":"/taxonomy/term/5105"}],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_